WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.900
Let's round 47 to the nearest ten.

2
00:03.900 --> 00:06.200
45 is halfway between 40 and 50.

3
00:06.200 --> 00:08.600
47 is past halfway, on the 50 side.

4
00:08.600 --> 00:12.200
47 is 3 away from 50. It is 7 away from 40.

5
00:12.200 --> 00:18.100
47 is closer to 50, so we round up to 50.
